★ [saf-intentions-231] (operationality: 4/5)
  "Binding AI Accountability to Physical Infrastructure Metrics" — An Intention within safetyist discourse that conditions the legal authorization of high-stakes AI systems on verifiable, real-time telemetry from physical compute infrastructure.
Encompasses: hardware-level attestation of operational boundaries, real-time grid and cooling impact monitoring, cryptographically signed logs of compute usage, independent forensic access to physical infrastructure.
